---
description: >-
  C4Deployment diagram with a Deployment_Node (Data Center) containing two
  sibling nested Deployment_Nodes (App Server, DB Server), each wrapping a
  Container/ContainerDb respectively, connected by a single Rel — exercises
  sibling nesting rather than the linear deep-nesting chain used elsewhere.
---
C4Deployment
title Deployment diagram
Deployment_Node(dc, "Data Center", "us-east-1") {
  Deployment_Node(srv, "App Server", "Ubuntu 22.04") {
    Container(api, "API", "Java, Spring")
  }
  Deployment_Node(dbn, "DB Server", "Ubuntu 22.04") {
    ContainerDb(db, "Database", "PostgreSQL")
  }
}
Rel(api, db, "reads/writes", "JDBC")
